WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.554
Welcome to Orbit. What comes next. Our focus is be going to.

2
00:00:06.554 --> 00:00:12.392
Use am, is or are going to plus a base verb for a plan made before speaking.

3
00:00:12.392 --> 00:00:15.277
Rosa is going to have a picnic.

4
00:00:15.277 --> 00:00:18.366
We are going to invite six friends.

5
00:00:18.366 --> 00:00:20.920
I am going to bring juice.

6
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:30.318
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
